  <item>
    <title>NO.008-裸辞2个月，焦虑暴瘦，我如何自救的？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a465f47349f7a557d802f7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a465f47349f7a557d802f7</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 27 Jul 2024 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>终于开始了新生活，我才有勇气去回顾过去的2个月～我就是一个承受能力巨差的人！当你焦虑到一个程度的时候就有可能抑郁～我知道肯定有很多跟我一样的人！我们不能放任这种情绪生长，所以无论我们自己处于什么糟糕或者焦虑的状态，都要千万次拯救自己于水火，与大家共勉之！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a>离职的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a>为什么选择裸辞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a>裸辞之后我做了哪些尝试（自媒体/电商）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a>焦虑爆发的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="910">15:10</a>开始自救</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a>结语分享</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢大家，希望大家听的开心！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lttTwgS-K1sHeBCLUsDRLTVK9goH.m4a" length="23773963" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:24:29</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnX3jATjtR3G38rAK1x9TxIzfPUY.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>NO.007-《认知觉醒》｜如何提升你的认知？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/669897e037236c546ef95d34</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">669897e037236c546ef95d34</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 18 Jul 2024 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“认知决定一个人的上限”，像我们经常听到的“一个人是赚不到他认知之外的钱的”～所以我们每个人也都或多或少的了解并知道，认知的重要性！那么怎么提升认知？怎么通过认知去解决我们生活工作中遇到的困难？怎么通过提升认知让我们短暂的人生过的更加幸福一些呢？带着这些疑问我们来一起学习下：</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>什么是认知</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a>认知/心智的定义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a>认知觉醒的定义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">05:20</a>认知是怎么工作的：本能脑、情绪脑和理智脑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a>理智脑弱小的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a>本能脑、情绪脑和理智脑合作共赢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">27:40</a>潜意识对认知的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1585">26:25</a>元认知的定义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2370">39:30</a>如何获取元认知能力</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>培养认知</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2770">46:10</a>怎么提升专注力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3080">51:20</a>怎么提升学习力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3500">58:20</a>怎么提升行动力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3750">01:02:30</a>怎么提升情绪力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4110">01:08:30</a>人生5件套，早冥读写跑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4770">01:19:30</a>一流的生活不是富有，而是觉知</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢大家，希望大家听的开心！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnTtzXRb3dYMP_cZ8qqOLBBKjRwG.m4a" length="78894680" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:21:18</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnX3jATjtR3G38rAK1x9TxIzfPUY.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
